    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Prerequisites</strong> Juggernaut Warforged heritage</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Trigger</strong> You attempt a saving throw</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You brace yourself and your defences. When you attempt a saving throw, you gain a +2 status bonus to the triggering saving throw.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Enhancement</strong> You use your constructed nature to resist and endure as you were built to do. You can use Incredible Defense once per 10 minutes, rather than once per hour.</p>"
    },
